# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform. Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which made
# the committed samples differ from what the tools write (byte-for-byte tests: import_demo_reimport, the scene
# round trip in test_editor). Binary files are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
*.fbx binary
*.mce binary
*.zip binary
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
